</node>
<node id="森林">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">The forest where Aly begins her adventure and faces the first test on the stone bridge.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="巨大的蜘蛛">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">A large spider encountered by Aly on the stone bridge, representing a test of courage.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="短剑">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">A short sword given to Aly by her father, used in the battle against the spider.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="花园">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">A mysterious garden Aly enters, the site of a test of wisdom.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="花朵">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Various flowers in the garden, which represent a puzzle Aly needs to solve to pass the test of wisdom.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="石门">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">A hidden stone door that opens after Aly solves the puzzle in the garden.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="湖">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">A serene lake Aly arrives at, the site of a test of kindness.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="水晶">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">A glowing crystal in the middle of the lake, which Aly receives as a reward for passing all the tests.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="小鸟">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">A wounded bird that tests Aly's kindness and rewards her with the crystal.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="古老王国">
  <data key="d0">geo</data>
  <data key="d1">An ancient kingdom that was shrouded in mist, revealed by Aly after passing all the tests.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7342c9ad28631086988033c9ebea87ff</data>
</node>
<node id="人们">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
